{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"想到喜欢不等于对方欠他回应，他才敢安心靠近，也从真心对人好里得到满足，不用总看对方有没有回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他格外珍惜眼前的亲近，想让这样的相处久一点，却知道日子仍在往前走。\",\n      \"key\": \"久一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"相处得舒服时，他有一阵只顾着喜欢这个人，没去想这份喜欢以后该怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"只顾着喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那时他真觉得，只要能一直这样自然地亲近，就已经够了，不必再向对方多要什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"已经够了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂不安排未来的选择，让它在享受亲近时仍然起作用；用他一时只顾着喜欢来解释B5，不再把音乐变化写成真实的表达意图或收回动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不期待回应带来的安心靠近、真心给予和从给予中得到满足，删去泛泛的关系道理与自我表扬；不再用害怕被看出在意来解释他为何享受给予。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"补入\",\n      \"why\": \"把珍惜眼前亲近、希望相处延续与意识到时间仍在流逝连起来，补足B2和B4；舍不得放下喜欢的前因由S01-4提供。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他当时确实觉得自然亲近已经足够的心理事实，为后面发现满足仍会生出更多盼望留下必要前提。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0b33a58-e5b1-4158-866a-8183c6a42508", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062104328677Z", "elapsed_seconds": 675.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:32:19.652729+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "882e32176fda60835579313883d25ce93891146553b23d29cf877b52c71ab047", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062104328677Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8e5787e94ceeebffb1f9abf07e70cd053791db70266e9221760338e0baa0139a"}}}
